{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24897","headline":"赋得琢玉成器 · 叶季良","name":"赋得琢玉成器","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"片玉寄幽石，纷纶当代名。\n荆人献始遇，良匠琢初成。\n冰映寒光动，虹开晚色明。\n雅容看更澈，余响扣弥清。\n自与琼瑶比，方随掌握荣。\n因知君有用，高价伫连城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"叶季良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}